84	Performance varies with temperature (Appendix~\ref{app:sampling-sensitivity}): Pythia-2.8B improves at $t{=}0.5$ (binary F1\,=\,0.814 vs.\ 0.740 at $t{=}0.7$), while Qwen3-1.7B is stable (0.751).

